Document the request fields a controller method reads through a fields class.

A controller method with #[RequestFieldsFrom(Fields::class)] reads its
optional request parameters from the public properties of that class (see
OCA\Versioniq\Http\RequestFields) instead of declaring them as method
parameters. The extractor only knows method parameters, so this patch adds
each public property as if the method declared it: same name, native type
and default, and its @var tag in place of the @param tag. The generated
document is the same as with the parameters on the method.

Not upstream: the attribute is versioniq's own.

--- a/src/ControllerMethod.php
+++ b/src/ControllerMethod.php
@@ -8,9 +8,12 @@
